# wheel — CVE-2026-24049
# Trivy detects wheel 0.45.1 in python:3.11-slim base layer.
# Dockerfile upgrades to 0.47.0 then uninstalls entirely.
# Running container has no wheel installed (confirmed: pip list | grep wheel = empty).
# Base layer metadata is non-exploitable — wheel is not present at runtime.
CVE-2026-24049

# jaraco.context — CVE-2026-23949
# Trivy detects 5.3.0 in python:3.11-slim base layer.
# Dockerfile upgrades to 6.1.2 (fix threshold: 6.1.0).
# Running container has jaraco.context 6.1.2 — patched version confirmed installed.
# This is a Trivy false positive: fixed version is present, old version is a ghost base layer.
CVE-2026-23949

